// CITS5017 Lecture 4 — Processing Sequences Using RNNs and CNNs (52 slides).
// Pure data extracted from the lecture PDF (every slide read; equation and figure slides rendered and
// checked symbol by symbol) and cross-checked against the markdown transcript. Every item cites the exact
// slide(s) where the claim is printed. Notation is the slides' own: row vectors (x⊤W), ⊤ for transpose,
// φ for a generic activation, σ for the logistic function, ⊗ for element-wise multiplication.
// Items with `beyond: true` are NOT stated on the slides; their `note` says why they are here.

